In the model under consideration, the group soft thresholding estimator 
$\hat{\bfT}^{\rm GST}$
can be defined as the minimizer of the group-lasso cost function, that is
\begin{equation}\label{definition_ST}
	\hat{\bfT}^{\rm GST} = \arg\min_{\mathbf{T}}
